ll,$q$B$q$,$q$B$q$,false,$q$Science & Technology$q$,$q$Physics$q$,$q$Geometrical & Physical Optics$q$,$q$Conditions for total internal reflection$q$,'Knowledge',$q$Single MCQ$q$,$q$PATTERN.DIRECT$q$,$q$Concept: total internal reflection needs light going from a denser to a rarer medium with the angle of incidence greater than the critical angle.
