select b.id,63,null,$q$Two conducting wires made of the same material have lengths L and 1.2 L. If the volume of the longer wire is half that of the shorter wire, then what is the electric resistance of the longer wire in comparison with the shorter wire?$q$,$q$288% larger$q$,$q$200% larger$q$,$q$188% larger$q$,$q$108% larger$q$,0.98,'{}'::text[],$q$NDA_II_2026_GK_063$q$,$q$Two conducting wires made of the same material have lengths L and 1.2 L. If the volume of the longer wire is half that of the shorter wire, then what is the electric resistance of the longer wire in comparison with the shorter wire?$q$,$q$288% larger$q$,$q$200% larger$q$,$q$188% larger$q$,$q$108% larger$q$,$q$9a819ecb0e15555281d19ccf61f1bc6b5430cde59d2fc9f415facd8e8238ed6f$q$,$q$C$q$,'MODEL_ONLY',$q$dp-solved://NDA_2026_II_GAT_GK_SET_A$q$,null,$q$C$q$,$q$C$q$,false,$q$Science & Technology$q$,$q$Physics$q$,$q$Electricity & Electric Circuits$q$,$q$Resistance of wires of different geometry$q$,'Knowledge',$q$Single MCQ$q$,$q$PATTERN.DIRECT$q$,$q$Concept: $R=\rho\frac{\ell}{A}=\rho\frac{\ell^2}{V}$.
