Answer: (c)$q$,$q$NDA II 2026 General Ability Test Part B (English side)$q$,false,array['format:single_mcq','key:dp_solved'],$q$Static$q$,42.25,$q$Moderate$q$,0.97,0.85,0.85,false,'ENRICHED','INCLUDE',$q$Resistance of wires of different geometry$q$,$q$COMP.SNT.PHYSICS$q$,$q$SRC.NCERT.SCIENCE$q$,$q$TEMP.STATIC$q$,80,90,100,60,57.75,0,0,0,0,$q${"answer_audit": {"authority": "DP_SOLVED_INTERNAL", "note": "Not an official UPSC key"}, "source_explanation_evidence": {"captured": true, "provider": "DP internal solved key", "text": "Concept: $R=\\rho\\frac{\\ell}{A}=\\rho\\frac{\\ell^2}{V}$.\nStep 1: $\\frac{R_2}{R_1}=\\frac{(1.2)^2}{1}\\times\\frac{V_1}{V_2}=1.44\\times2=2.88$.\nStep 2: the longer wire's resistance is 2.88 times, i.e. 188% larger.\nAnswer: (c)"}}$q$::jsonb from b
