select b.id,70,null,$q$An insulating container contains 250 g of water at 20°C. Steam at 100°C is passed through it, heating it up to 25°C. During this process, part of the steam also gets condensed, raising the mass of water to 252 g. If the specific heat of water is 1 Cal g⁻¹ °C⁻¹, then what is the value of the latent heat of steam?$q$,$q$530 Cal/g$q$,$q$540 Cal/g$q$,$q$550 Cal/g$q$,$q$560 Cal/g$q$,0.98,'{}'::text[],$q$NDA_II_2026_GK_070$q$,$q$An insulating container contains 250 g of water at 20°C. Steam at 100°C is passed through it, heating it up to 25°C. During this process, part of the steam also gets condensed, raising the mass of water to 252 g. If the specific heat of water is 1 Cal g⁻¹ °C⁻¹, then what is the value of the latent heat of steam?$q$,$q$530 Cal/g$q$,$q$540 Cal/g$q$,$q$550 Cal/g$q$,$q$560 Cal/g$q$,$q$b2296f57899f9d5d15803746a700ffab7c4b3d850533b0d5e7e5fd86b9bd0dc3$q$,$q$C$q$,'MODEL_ONLY',$q$dp-solved://NDA_2026_II_GAT_GK_SET_A$q$,null,$q$C$q$,$q$C$q$,false,$q$Science & Technology$q$,$q$Physics$q$,$q$Thermodynamics, Heat & Kinetic Theory$q$,$q$Calorimetry with steam$q$,'Knowledge',$q$Single MCQ$q$,$q$PATTERN.DIRECT$q$,$q$Step 1: heat gained by the water $=250\times1\times5=1250$ Cal.
Step 2: 2 g of steam condensed, giving $2L+2\times1\times(100-25)=1250$.
Step 3: $2L=1100\Rightarrow L=550$ Cal/g.
Answer: (c)$q$,$q$NDA II 2026 General Ability Test Part B (English side)$q$,false,array['format:single_mcq','key:dp_solved'],$q$Static$q$,42.25,$q$Moderate$q$,0.97,0.85,0.85,false,'ENRICHED','INCLUDE',$q$Calorimetry with steam$q$,$q$COMP.SNT.PHYSICS$q$,$q$SRC.NCERT.SCIENCE$q$,$q$TEMP.STATIC$q$,80,90,100,60,57.75,0,0,0,0,$q${"answer_audit": {"authority": "DP_SOLVED_INTERNAL", "note": "Not an official UPSC key"}, "source_explanation_evidence": {"captured": true, "provider": "DP internal solved key", "text": "Step 1: heat gained by the water $=250\\times1\\times5=1250$ Cal.\nStep 2: 2 g of steam condensed, giving $2L+2\\times1\\times(100-25)=1250$.\nStep 3: $2L=1100\\Rightarrow L=550$ Cal/g.\nAnswer: (c)"}}$q$::jsonb from b
